# Security: malware and rootkit investigation (gap analysis section 5).
clamav               # Offline malware scanning of mounted disks; databases come from freshclam (D6)
yara                 # Rule-based file matching; rules are brought by the user (gap analysis 5.2)
rkhunter             # Rootkit and suspicious-file checks
unhide               # Hidden process and port detection on a live suspect system
